 "_tokens": "@guideStatus, @needsAttention and @daysLeft are worked out by sim-verify.sh from the profile stub's RemovalDate (Fixtures/local/profile) and the Mac's clock, as GuideState.from does: the 7-day profile of Sep 21 reads 'active' until Sep 27 19:40Z, 'expiringSoon' for its last day, 'expired' after.",
 "_design": "design.json WP7 lists 17 shots; the critique adds 'radio rach' (18). 'radio carriers' moves the cursor to 15.5 s, where the PCell and all 3 SCells are active, so the grid has something to show. The MAC DL section (0xB063) is the 19th shot; the DL, UL, signal and antennas sections gained the series of the decoders added after the reference extractor.",
